he database is available and the request body has a valid title, area, and priority.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client posts a valid request once without description and once with a description that is blank after trimming.\",\n     \"then\": \"Both response statuses are 201 and neither returned resource has a description field.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-2.3\",\n     \"given\": \"The database operation for creating a valid request fails after startup.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client posts the request.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 500 and the response message is \\\"Could not create the request.\\\"\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"REQ-3\",\n   \"ears\": \"If a POST /api/requests body is malformed or violates the CreateRequest schema, then the Maintenance Requests API shall return HTTP 400 with a contract ErrorResponse and no created row, using only contract-defined validation constraints and errors.\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"anchors\": [\n    {\n     \"path\": \"contracts/openapi.yaml\",\n     \"lineStart\": 90,\n     \"lineEnd\": 101,\n     \"quote\": \"        '400':\\n          description: Malformed JSON, invalid field types, missing or invalid fields, or invalid values. No request is created.\\n          content:\\n            application/json:\\n              schema:\\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\\n              example:\\n                message: Request validation failed.\\n                errors:\\n                  title: [Title must be 3 to 80 characters.]\\n                  area: [Area is required.]\\n                  description: [Description must be at most 500 characters.]\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"path\": \"contracts/openapi.yaml\",\n     \"lineStart\": 261,\n     \"lineEnd\": 289,\n     \"quote\": \"    CreateRequest:\\n      type: object\\n      additionalProperties: false\\n      required: [title, area, priority]\\n      description: Title and description are trimmed before validation and storage. Optional id, createdAt, or status inputs are ignored and replaced by system values.\\n      properties:\\n        title:\\n          type: string\\n          minLength: 3\\n          maxLength: 80\\n        area:\\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestArea'\\n        priority:\\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestPriority'\\n        description:\\n          type: string\\n          maxLength: 500\\n        id:\\n          type: integer\\n          format: int64\\n          description: Optional caller-supplied value is ignored.\\n        createdAt:\\n          type: string\\n          format: date-time\\n          description: Optional caller-supplied value is ignored.\\n        status:\\n          allOf:\\n            - $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestStatus'\\n          description: Optional caller-supplied value is ignored; created requests start Open.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-3\"\n   ],\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.1\",\n     \"given\": \"The request table has a known row count.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client posts a request with a two-character title or omits the title.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 400, the response message is \\\"Request validation failed.\\\", response field errors.title contains \\\"Title must be 3 to 80 characters.\\\", and the request row count is unchanged.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.2\",\n     \"given\": \"The request table has a known row count.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client posts a request without area or with an area outside the contract enum.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 400, the response message is \\\"Request validation failed.\\\", response field errors.area identifies the invalid or missing area (including \\\"Area is required.\\\" when area is missing), and the request row count is unchanged.\",\n     \"