uest not found.\\\"\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.3\",\n     \"given\": \"The database operation for loading an existing request fails for a reason other than the request being absent.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client calls GET /api/requests/{id}.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 500 and the response message is \\\"Could not load the request.\\\"\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"REQ-5\",\n   \"ears\": \"When a client sends PATCH /api/requests/{id}/status, the Maintenance Requests API shall return HTTP 200 with the updated resource for only the transitions Open to In progress, In progress to Done, and Done to Open, HTTP 400 for an unsupported status or immutable or extra properties, HTTP 404 with message \\\"Request not found.\\\" for an unknown id, HTTP 409 with message \\\"This status transition is not allowed.\\\" for any other transition, and HTTP 500 with message \\\"Could not update the request.\\\" when updating fails.\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"anchors\": [\n    {\n     \"path\": \"contracts/openapi.yaml\",\n     \"lineStart\": 163,\n     \"lineEnd\": 166,\n     \"quote\": \"    patch:\\n      operationId: changeRequestStatus\\n      summary: Change a request's status\\n      description: Only status is mutable. Allowed transitions are Open to In progress, In progress to Done, and Done to Open. Requests with immutable fields or other extra properties are rejected.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"path\": \"contracts/openapi.yaml\",\n     \"lineStart\": 189,\n     \"lineEnd\": 214,\n     \"quote\": \"        '400':\\n          description: Unsupported status value or attempt to change an immutable field.\\n          content:\\n            application/json:\\n              schema:\\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\\n              example:\\n                message: Status must be Open, In progress, or Done; only status may be changed.\\n     